<title>USA: Times Mirror sees small gain on buy.</title>
<headline>Times Mirror sees small gain on buy.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Times Mirror Co Wednesday said it compledted the acquisition of Shepard's, the nation's premier legal citation service, from McGraw-Hill Companies Inc in exchange for the Times Mirror Higher Education Group and additional undisclosed consideration.</p>
<p>In a statement, Times Mirror said it expects to report a small gain on the exchange net of special charges related to the transaction.</p>
